WEBVTT

NOTE
Illustrated menu-path guide. Not an actual screen recording.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.333
Request your own TikTok data, then review which relationship information your archive includes.

2
00:00:06.333 --> 00:00:11.417
Tap Profile, open the Menu, then choose Settings and privacy.

3
00:00:11.417 --> 00:00:14.958
Choose Account, then Download your data.

4
00:00:14.958 --> 00:00:21.625
Choose the information and format. Use JSON if offered, then tap Request data.

5
00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:28.708
Preparation may take days. Return to Download data and collect the file within four days of availability.

6
00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:36.542
Choose the file in the Genie's Import Studio. Archive formats vary, so review the recognized people and handles.
